---
import Layout from '../layouts/Portfolio.astro';
import {projects} from '../portfolio';
---
<Layout>
<section class="hero">
  <div><div class="overline">LUFFY LU / SELECTED WORK</div><h1>把复杂流程<br/>做成好用的工具。</h1><p>我做 Web 应用，关注数据怎样进入系统、决策怎样被记录，以及出错后用户怎样继续工作。</p><div class="links"><a class="cta" href="#projects">浏览项目 ↓</a></div></div>
</section>
<section id="projects" aria-label="项目列表"><div class="section-label overline">01–02 / 项目档案</div>
<div class="grid">{projects.map(project=><article class="card"><span class="case-index">{project.number}</span><div class="card-copy"><div class="overline">{project.name}</div><h2>{project.title}</h2><p>{project.description}</p><div class="links"><a class="cta" href={'/projects/'+project.id+'/'}>查看项目</a><a href={project.demo}>打开演示 ↗</a></div></div></article>)}</div>
</section>
</Layout>
